---
import Layout from '../../components/Layout.astro';
import Matcher from '../../components/Matcher.astro';
---

<Layout
	path="/tools/free-font-alternative-finder"
	title="Free Font Alternative Finder — Free Lookalikes for Paid Fonts"
	description="Every commercial typeface has a free lookalike. Find free alternatives to Helvetica, Gotham, Futura and more — open-source fonts licensed for commercial use."
	canonical="/tools/free-font-alternative-finder"
>
	<section class="container-page py-12 sm:py-16">
		<p class="eyebrow">Tools</p>
		<h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-display-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">
			Free font alternative finder
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-body">
			You found the font — it’s $300 a seat. Every paid typeface in our database is paired with the
			free Google Font that reads closest on the page.
		</p>

		<div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-left">
			<Matcher />
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="container-page pb-16 sm:pb-24">
		<div class="max-w-3xl">
			<h2 class="text-display-md font-semibold tracking-tight">Classic pairings, for reference</h2>
			<ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-body-md text-body">
				<li><strong>Helvetica</strong> → Inter or Roboto</li>
				<li><strong>Gotham</strong> → Montserrat</li>
				<li><strong>Futura</strong> → Jost or Poppins</li>
				<li><strong>Avenir</strong> → Nunito Sans or Mulish</li>
				<li><strong>Circular</strong> → Poppins or DM Sans</li>
				<li><strong>Gill Sans</strong> → Lato or Cabin</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-display-md font-semibold tracking-tight">How to judge an alternative</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-body-md text-body">
				A good alternative doesn’t need to be a clone — it needs to match what readers actually
				notice: proportions and page texture (x-height, letter width, stroke weight), not the shape
				of one terminal. Run your original image through the <a class="text-link" href="/">font
				finder</a>, then compare the top candidates side by side in the preview box before
				committing. Digits are often the fastest giveaway between near-identical faces.
			</p>

			<p class="mt-6 text-body-md text-body">
				Browse every pairing in our catalog on the{' '}
				<a class="text-link hover:underline" href="/fonts?category=sans-serif">fonts page</a>, or read
				the guide to <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="/guides/free-alternatives-to-commercial-fonts">
				finding free alternatives to commercial fonts</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
